WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.180
Try to explain the colour yellow
to someone who has never seen it.

2
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.880
You can't break it into parts,
the way you can describe a horse.

3
00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:09.660
You can only point.

4
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:14.750
In 1903, G E Moore said the
word good works the same way.

5
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.070
Good, he said, is good.

6
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:21.850
But if nobody can define good, how
could anyone know what is good?

7
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.650
In this mission, you'll meet the
view that moral truths are real,

8
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.890
yet nothing you can see, measure or test.

9
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.040
Then you'll put that view under pressure,

10
00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:33.670
and weigh its strengths and its problems.

11
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.310
Your mission: find out how
anyone could know what is good,

12
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:39.160
if good cannot be defined.
